    "detailed_description": "Howdy y'all! Welcome to G.O.M.P! Also called Get Off My Property, ya hear?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is the game where you play as a tough-as-nails redneck defending your farm from an endless swarm of invaders who are trying to steal your food.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGrab your trusty weapon and get ready for some fast-paced action-packed gameplay that'll test your shooting skills and survival instincts. Whether you're playing solo or with your buddies, G.O.M.P! offers a rootin' tootin' good time that'll keep you on the edge of your seat.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCompete against your friends to see who can rack up the highest score and become the ultimate redneck defender. But be warned, each wave of invaders gets harder and harder to defeat, so you'll need to stay on your toes and be ready for anything.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith each game session lasting between 10-15 minutes, G.O.M.P! is perfect for a quick gaming break or a marathon session. So what are you waiting for? It's time to defend your farm and show those pesky invaders who's boss!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGet G.O.M.P! today and get ready to blast your way through wave after wave of enemies. Yeehaw!",
